        "pf_4c2ac5e6_value": "<b><span><span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 156, 39);\"></span></span></span></b><strong><b><span><span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 156, 39);\"></span></span></span></b><b><span><span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 156, 39);\"></span></span></span></b><b><span><span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 156, 39);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(250, 108, 168);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(244, 7, 36);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(228, 211, 16);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(234, 217, 13);\">★</span></span></span></span></span></span></span>&nbsp;ThePhotoStick® Omni 32GB: </b><b>$50.99&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</b><b><s>$59.99</s> &nbsp;</b><s><br></s><b><span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 156, 39);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(250, 108, 168);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(244, 7, 36);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(234, 217, 13);\">★</span></span></span></span></span></b><b><span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 156, 39);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(250, 108, 168);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(244, 7, 36);\"></span></span></span></span>&nbsp;ThePhotoStick® Omni 64GB: $67.99&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<s>$79.99</s>&nbsp; &nbsp;</b><s><br></s><b><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 156, 39);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(250, 108, 168);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(244, 7, 36);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(234, 217, 13);\">★</span></span></span></span>&nbsp;ThePhotoStick® Omni 128GB:&nbsp;$84.99&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<s>$99.99</s></b><s><br></s><b><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 156, 39);\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 156, 39);\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 156, 39);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(250, 108, 168);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(244, 7, 36);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(234, 217, 13);\">★</span></span></span></span>&nbsp;ThePhotoStick® Omni 256GB:</b> <b></b>$127.49&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<s>$149.99<br><span style=\"color: rgb(252, 213, 63);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 156, 39);\"></span></span></s><span style=\"color: rgb(252, 213, 63);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 156, 39);\"></span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(252, 213, 63);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 156, 39);\"></span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(252, 213, 63);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 156, 39);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(250, 108, 168);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(244, 7, 36);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(234, 217, 13);\">★</span></span></span></span></span> <b>ThePhotoStick® Omni 512GB:</b> <b></b>$169.14&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<s>$198.99</s></strong><s><br></s>",
        "pf_015765a4_value": "Yes, getting started with ThePhotoStick Omni is incredibly easy! Please note, however, that it will take some time for ThePhotoStick Omni to find each of your photos and safely back them up. This time can vary depending on how many photos you have, the size of your files, and the type of device you are using. But the great thing about ThePhotoStick Omni is that anyone can use it, no matter how comfortable they are with technology!<br><br>Check out our <b><a href=\"https://www.manula.com/manuals/product-support/thephotostick-omni-official-user-guide/\" target=\"_blank\">User Guide</a></b> for more information on getting started with ThePhotoStick® Omni. We also offer 24/7 support if you have any questions or difficulties: support@thephotostick.com",
        "pf_09ec67c5_value": "Almost all major Android, iPhone, and iPad devices!<br><br>It's compatible with Windows, Android, and Mac Operating Systems:<br>- Windows: Windows 7 SP1 and later<br>- Apple: iOS and iPadOS 13.0 and later<br>- Android: 6.0 and later*<i><br></i><sup>*ThePhotoStick Omni is NOT compatible with Google Pixel smartphones.<br></sup><br>For more up to date information regarding ThePhotoStick compatibility, we recommend viewing our <a href=\"/pages/support-system-requirements\" target=\"_self\">System Requirements</a> page.&nbsp;",
        "pf_be354a40_value": "We are committed to delighting each customer of ThePhotoStick. We are so confident you will love it, that we offer a no-risk 30-Day Money Back Guarantee, starting at the day of delivery.\n<br><br>Try out our full line of ThePhotoStick products, with no risk! If you have any issues and are not completely satisfied with your purchase for whatever reason, simply contact returns@thephotostick.com or visit our Live Chat support at thephotostick.com.",
        "pf_64dad9ed_value": "ThePhotoStick® Omni is a small device that can find and sort thousands of photos and videos on ANY device. It automatically finds and sorts your favorite files with complete accuracy to ensure no memory is ever missed. You can now safely store and share each and every precious moment with ONE device.<br><br>Works on popular desktop computers, laptops, tablets, and mobile phones from Windows, Mac, Android, and iPhone.",
        "pf_9e22a5f8_value": "We offer a no-hassle, 30-Day Money Back Guarantee. If you’re not 100% satisfied with your purchase from ThePhotoStick®, we are happy to help you with a return. We want you to be happy!<br><br>If you are not completely satisfied with your order, please contact us at returns@thephotostick.com and we'd be happy to facilitate your return and refund.",
        "pf_8b821bb4_value": "Enjoy this time with the ones you love most, and let ThePhotoStick Omni do the hard work for you.<br><br>You'll never have to waste hours of time trying to find, organize, and backup each of your photos and videos, again.\n\nThePhotoStick Omni can find, sort and organize your most treasured files. No lost hours. No missed photos. No Cloud fees.",
        "pf_0ab25daf_value": "ThePhotoStick® Omni is a small device that can find and sort thousands of photos and videos on ANY device. It automatically finds and sorts your favorite files with complete accuracy to ensure no memory is ever missed.&nbsp;<br><br>Works on popular desktop computers, laptops, tablets, and mobile phones from Windows, Mac, Android, and iPhone.",
        "pf_751160c5_value": "Approximate Number of Photos Stored on ThePhotoStick USB:<br><br>32 GB - 12,800 photos<br>64 GB - 25,600 photos<br>128 GB - 51,200 photos<br>256 GB - 102,400 photos<br>512 GB - 204,800 photos<br><br>*Please note that storage capacity per GB listed above is approximate, and exact storage amounts vary depending on file type and size.",
        "pf_422c7d7a_value": "I got all my pictures, screenshots and downloads off my phone, tablet and laptop. What a relief. I have had several phones die over the years and so much info was on them. I don't trust drop box or just saving photos on a device, google took ALL of mine and I have no idea where they are. This photo stick is worth every penny.",
        "pf_0e2064dc_value": "Price with Checkout Code:<br><br>ThePhotoStick Omni 32GB: <b>$47.99</b>&nbsp; <s>$59.99</s><br>ThePhotoStick Omni 64GB: <b>$63.99</b>&nbsp; <s>$79.99</s><br>ThePhotoStick Omni 128GB: <b>$79.99</b>&nbsp; <s>$99.99</s> - 👑 Popular!<br>ThePhotoStick Omni 256GB: <b>$119.99</b>&nbsp; <s>$149.99</s>",
        "pf_93e509e5_value": "Price with Checkout Code:<br><br>ThePhotoStick Omni 32GB: <b>$47.99</b>&nbsp; <s>$59.99</s><br>ThePhotoStick Omni 64GB: <b>$63.99</b>&nbsp; <s>$79.99</s><br>ThePhotoStick Omni 128GB: <b>$79.99</b>&nbsp; <s>$99.99</s> - 👑 Popular!<br>ThePhotoStick Omni 256GB: <b>$119.99</b>&nbsp; <s>$149.99</s>",
        "pf_5e5cf788_value": "Love it!! I had 2,500 photos on my iPhone and doubles. The stick in less than 3 minutes downloaded and deleted doubles. Now my phone is freed up and 2,000 originals are on the stick😃. Great gift idea for Christmas 🎄\rThanks also for the support of staff in answering emails so quickly.",
        "pf_0ba5daff_value": "Never risk losing your memories to the Cloud or accidents, again! ThePhotoStick® Omni automatically finds, sorts, and saves thousands of your most treasured photos and videos across any of your devices.<br><br>Easily keep every single memorable moment safe with ThePhotoStick® Omni.",
        "pf_e2c4022b_value": "Cherish and protect a lifetime of memorable moments with ThePhotoStick® Omni!<br><br>With our #1 photo backup device, you can effortlessly safeguard your precious photos and videos and ensure your memories last forever. <strong>Get yours today for 15% OFF!</strong>",
        "pf_ed11303b_value": "Of course! Visit our website, www.thephotostick.com, and click the gray circle near the bottom right corner of the page to begin chatting with a member of our Support Team.<br><br>Live Chat available Monday-Saturday, 8am-8pm PST",
        "pf_d6011fde_value": "USE CHECKOUT CODE <span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(244, 7, 36);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 118, 149);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(105, 202, 3);\">LUCKY25</span></span></span></span>&nbsp;FOR 15% OFF!",
        "pf_c8d86d6f_value": "This SO easy to work with. Simply pug it in, load the small app, and click. Sit back have a coffee or two. (If you are picture hoarder like me a short nap is good) I don't mean to imply it is slow I had a lot of pics.",
        "pf_c8f7fde5_value": "Love it love it love it One of the best things I have ever bought to put pictures on I have almost 4000 pictures on in and still have Room to add more easy to work easy to use. Such a great thing to have.",
        "pf_994933b1_value": "Yes, it’s a great backup solution! Many people plug ThePhotoStick® Omni in each night for a quick and easy backup to make sure they are continually protecting their memories.\r\r",
        "pf_100635d2_value": "🌟<b>New Year's Flash Sale</b><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">:</span> Use Checkout Code<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"> NEWMEMORIES&nbsp;</span>to Receive 20% OFF! 🌟",
        "pf_12b983c8_value": "🌟<b>New Year's Flash Sale</b><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">:</span> Use Checkout Code<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"> NEWMEMORIES&nbsp;</span>to Receive 20% OFF! 🌟",
        "pf_892724db_value": "SHOP NOW &amp; SAVE BIG - <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 156, 39);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(1, 164, 239);\">GET 15% OFF</span></span>&nbsp;WHEN YOU BUY TODAY!",
        "pf_16d2a687_value": "It's easy to use and it searched my computer for pictures and videos. This is so worth getting. It's 128gb and it also has a cover.",
        "pf_fdfee369_value": "Depending on your country, it is possible that you will be charged one or more of these fees when you receive your order. \r\r",
